{"id":"00f528e893a47b3f","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-weak-separation.md","title":"Weak Separation in a System","display":"df-weak-separation — Weak Separation in a System","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-weak-separation","aliases":["92-df-weak-separation"],"display":"df-weak-separation — Weak Separation in a System","source":"第 VII 章 p. 87（PDF 104）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-separation-in-system]]","[[92-df-formula-instance]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-weak-separation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-weak-separation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-weak-separation — Weak Separation in a System"},{"key":"source","html":"第 VII 章 p. 87（PDF 104）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"905868da4e6087cf\" href=\"?note=905868da4e6087cf\" title=\"92-df-separation-in-system\">92-df-separation-in-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd18c4d476f594a\" href=\"?note=8bd18c4d476f594a\" title=\"92-df-formula-instance\">92-df-formula-instance</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\geq1\">\\(k\\geq1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_G(F)\\subseteq\\{v_i\\mid i&lt;k\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_G(F)\\subseteq\\{v_i\\mid i&lt;k\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Inst}_G^k\">\\(\\mathrm{Inst}_G^k\\)</span> 为实例操作。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WeakSep}_{\\mathcal S}^k\">\\(\\mathrm{WeakSep}_{\\mathcal S}^k\\)</span> 为下文定义的分离关系。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}weak\\text{-}separation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{WeakSep}_{\\mathcal S}^k(F;A,B)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\forall\\vec n\\in A\\;\\mathcal S\\vdash\\mathrm{Inst}_G^k(F;\\overline{\\vec n})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\vec n\\in B\\;\\mathcal S\\nvdash\\mathrm{Inst}_G^k(F;\\overline{\\vec n}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}weak\\text{-}separation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{WeakSep}_{\\mathcal S}^k(F;A,B)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\forall\\vec n\\in A\\;\\mathcal S\\vdash\\mathrm{Inst}_G^k(F;\\overline{\\vec n})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\vec n\\in B\\;\\mathcal S\\nvdash\\mathrm{Inst}_G^k(F;\\overline{\\vec n}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第二侧是不可证，不是可反驳。相当于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 按原书普通表示意义表示一个包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>、且与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 不交的集合；这个等价定义无需一致性。普通强分离推出弱分离时才用一致性，以排除正负实例同时可证。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 VII 章 p. 87（PDF 104）。页码同时给出印刷页与 PDF 页；所有公式均为本地重构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-separation-in-system","status":"resolved","id":"905868da4e6087cf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-separation-in-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula-instance","status":"resolved","id":"8bd18c4d476f594a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula-instance]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)","display":false},{"tex":"k\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k","display":false},{"tex":"F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}_G(F)\\subseteq\\{v_i\\mid i<k\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Inst}_G^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WeakSep}_{\\mathcal S}^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}weak\\text{-}separation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{WeakSep}_{\\mathcal S}^k(F;A,B)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\n\\forall\\vec n\\in A\\;\\mathcal S\\vdash\\mathrm{Inst}_G^k(F;\\overline{\\vec n})\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\vec n\\in B\\;\\mathcal S\\nvdash\\mathrm{Inst}_G^k(F;\\overline{\\vec n}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false}],"bytes":1413,"backlinks":[{"id":"8a3cbbd03d905ffa","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-75","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-local-binary-instance-code]] → [[92-df-weak-separation]] → [[92-lem-shepherdson-representation]] → [[92-thm-shepherdson-representation]]。"},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-99","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-weak-separation]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-217","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-weak-separation]]"}],"outgoing":["905868da4e6087cf","8bd18c4d476f594a"]}